      "message": "BTW, pvmfw can still fail (and reboot) after having printed this log.\n\nWould it be possible to use a log (or signal?) coming from the kernel/init instead? For example checking for [`DeathReason::Shutdown`](http://cs/android/packages/modules/Virtualization/virtualizationservice/aidl/android/system/virtualizationservice/DeathReason.aidl?l\u003d30) would be more thorough but is it possible from this Java code?",
