      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, we can move this log to the beginning of [1] to be more sure for now. Not sure how to check that DeathReason::Shutdown according to the existing examples and how stable that can be. Considering that this feature is for Android U, maybe we can stick with the current solution instead of exploring a new approach for the moment. wdyt?\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/entry.rs;l\u003d240;drc\u003dcafb9b966b2de7f8b5cabc91a379997ebc9e8a5a",
